          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Ahimaazi ukakaia kimusi imbiri ya mzuri, ukamzera, “Ghose ghakaia nicha.” Ukaghoghoma hata ukadunga chongo chake andonyi, ukaghamba, “BWANA Mlungu wako ndekaso, uo wawifunya noko awo wandu werekoghe wamaiza wa bwana wapo mzuri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukaghamba, “Uja mdawana Absalomu oko banana nicha?” Ahimaazi ukatumbulia, “Iji Joabu ukoghe ukiniduma ini mdumiki wako, nawonieghe nganyi imu mbaa, ela siimanyire ni ya indoki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukamzera, “Ghaluka na mbai kukaie kimusi aho.” Nao ukaghaluka na mbai, ukakaia kimusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
