              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mkushi ukabusa; ukaghamba, “Nareda malagho mecha kwa bwana wapo mzuri! Angu idime BWANA wakukira nandighi ra awo wose werekuwusiragha aighu yako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukamkotia mkushi, “Uja mdawana Absalomu oko banana?” Uja Mkushi ukatumbulia, “Wamaiza wa bwana wapo mzuri, na wose werekuwusiragha wikubonye kiwiwi, ndewikaie sa uo mdawana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
